      "value": "Moving Average Bands Fast Above Upper — SPY"
    },
    "规则": {
      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "本条只写 Vitali Apirine《Moving Average Bands》（TASC 2021-07；thinkorswim MovAvgBands）之 **快均线位于上轨之上** 新核。先算快/慢均线，慢线为中轨；再以两均线差的均方根为波动度，上轨=慢线+mult×RMS。日频：若 **FastAverage > UpperBand**（默认 fast=10, slow=50, mult=1, average type=EMA）→ 满仓 SPY，否则 BIL。不是慢线价上；不是快线>慢线金叉；不是布林上轨；不是 Keltner/STARC。计入美股/ETF。提出日期 2021-07-01。"
    },
